 # RasterArray
 
-The text representation summarizes the array's shape, data type, and whether it has
-an explicit mask. Pixel values, mask values, and the parent GeoTIFF are omitted.
-The shape is ordered as `(bands, height, width)`.
-
 ::: async_geotiff.RasterArray
     options:
       show_bases: false
